{{ENExclusive}}
'''Shakurel Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and was unlocked as a Stamp Reward during the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 497
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Shakurel Cat
|name2 = Shakurel Macho Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shakurel Macho Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Shakurel Cat can be used in much the same way as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], but it has two glaring drawbacks. The first is that it costs 60% more that Cat and most other Cat clones, and the second is that it moves at half the speed of Cat. On top of this, it lacks any useful stat bonuses or abilities which could redeem it in spite of its flaws. As a result, Shakurel Cat is generally a bad choice for an extra Cat-like meatshield, and only grows exponentially worse in stages which are lengthier and require more meatshields to be spawned, or in stages where money management is very important.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

